mFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">美国商务部正式批准OpenAI全面发布GPT-5.6模型</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">微软在Excel与Outlook中启用自研MAI模型以替代OpenAI和Anthropic</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Meta超级智能实验室发布Muse Image模型并接入Instagram与WhatsApp</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达发布统一音频大模型 Nemotron-Labs-Audex-30B-A3B</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ad388b8cf2ea4d52b0b880f7926cc7f3.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">NVIDIA研究团队正式发布统一音频-文本大语言模型Nemotron-Labs-Audex-30B-A3B（简称Audex）。该模型基于纯文本MoE架构与单一Transformer解码器构建，通过将音频输入投影至文本嵌入空间，实现了文本与量化音频token的统一处理，并与现有LLM基础设施无缝兼容。训练数据包含1574亿音频token与3205亿文本token，并采用多阶段监督训练、纯文本Cascade RL及多域在策略知识蒸馏技术。Audex在音频理解、语音识别、翻译及生成任务中表现领先，且几乎未出现推理、对齐及长文本处理能力的性能衰退。作为开源模型，Audex为开发者提供了可直接部署的成熟工具，解决了多模态模型中音频处理能力提升导致文本逻辑能力下降的行业难题，为复杂音频交互产品开发及多模态Agent研究提供</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯云开发升级微信AI小程序计划：免费赠送10亿Token额度及10万张生图额度</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/79d3cc7b12e157a4f48f7bb507f1b506.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯云开发宣布微信AI小程序成长计划大幅加码，向全行业开发者免费提供10亿Token大模型调用额度，并将AI生图免费额度从1万张提升至10万张。此次升级核心在于模型底层的全面换代，小程序内嵌模型已升级至腾讯最新一代混元Hy3模型及Hy Image 3.0生图模型，旨在提升文本理解力与图像生成效果。资源包有效期为6个月，全行业开发者均可无门槛申请。针对新人开发者，腾讯提供6个月免费个人版云开发环境；老用户则可获得配置升级或120元代金券。该计划覆盖文娱、工具及社交等多个行业，通过降低算力成本与研发门槛，助力开发者利用旗舰级AI能力进行产品创新与运营。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">美国商务部正式批准OpenAI全面发布GPT-5.6模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8d94ae718c271947526bf3fae3a9e6c2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">美国商务部已正式批准OpenAI大规模发布其先进AI模型GPT-5.6，该模型预计于本周内正式向公众推出。此前，受国家安全考量影响，GPT-5.6仅获准向经政府批准的有限实体开放，此次限制解除标志着临时管控措施的终结。该模型的放行得益于美国商务部下属AI标准与创新中心进行的密集测试，OpenAI技术团队为此专门驻扎华盛顿以配合审查。此次解禁正值美国即将出台新AI行政令之际，旨在将政府审查从临时管控转向制度化评估框架。对于行业而言，这一转变意味着政企关系正从“对抗式监管”向“协作式评估”过渡。在Anthropic等竞争对手仍受出口管制困扰的背景下，OpenAI率先获得全面推广许可，将显著提升其在高端AI市场的竞争优势，并为后续先进模型的发布确立了更清晰的合规路径。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软在Excel与Outlook中启用自研MAI模型以替代OpenAI和Anthropic</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/e2ab3ef4ec8c64bb0f52cf5c4949163e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软已正式在Excel和Outlook等核心Office产品中部署自研MAI系列模型，逐步替代此前依赖的OpenAI和Anthropic模型。目前，MAI模型每周处理数万条AI提示，标志着微软在降低AI运营成本及构建自主技术栈方面取得实质进展。微软AI模型主管穆斯塔法·苏莱曼明确表示，目标是减少并最终消除对外部顶级AI实验室的依赖。在今年6月的Build开发者大会上，微软发布了7款新模型，其中部分产品在编码能力上已对标Anthropic的Opus 4.6。除Office套件外，MAI模型正加速渗透至Teams视频会议转录及GitHub Copilot等高频办公场景。此举不仅旨在削减高昂的Token成本，更体现了微软从AI分销商向核心技术制造商转型的战略意图，通过掌握底层模型能力，确保在AI时代的自主权。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta超级智能实验室发布Muse Image模型并接入Instagram与WhatsApp</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3f697a92c5bb3a14fa7ca9bc12cbb8c2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Meta于7月7日正式推出首个图像生成模型Muse Image，该模型已集成至Meta AI应用，并同步登陆Instagram和WhatsApp。Muse Image支持对话式生成高质量图像，具备精准文字渲染、背景擦除及二维码生成能力。通过与Muse Spark配合，模型可实现多步骤规划、网页信息检索及视觉参考融合。用户可利用预设面板进行老照片修复、自拍风格转换或结合Facebook Marketplace商品进行室内设计预览。此外，Muse Image为Instagram Stories提供超30种AI特效，并支持通过圈画、草绘进行交互式编辑。目前该功能在部分地区免费开放，超出额度需订阅付费方案。Meta计划未来将该模型拓展至Facebook及Messenger，并向广告主开放Advantage+ creat</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
